Do you want to build an impactful career to change the world for the better? 
Geosyntec Consultants , Inc, headquartered in Boca Raton, FL, has an exciting opportunity in our North America West region for a Marketing and Proposal Specialist supporting our team across California from our San Diego, Sacramento, Orange County, Los Angeles, CA offices. The opportunity to work a fully remote (must be available to work standard business hours aligned within the Pacific Time Zone) schedule from your home-office may be available for this position at the discretion of the Company. The position will support our talented technical practitioners with developing compliant, comprehensive, and compelling submittals (proposals and statements of qualifications (SOQs)). Utilizing superb writing, organizational, and communication skills, the role will participate in the Go/No-Go process; manage, schedule, edit, and produce submittals and related sales-support materials; evaluate selection criteria; and develop appropriate response strategies.
Geosyntec is an innovative, international engineering and consulting firm serving private and public-sector clients to address new ventures and complex problems involving our environment, natural resources, and civil infrastructure. Our engineers, scientists, technical and project employees serve our clients from offices across the world. Ranked by ENR as one of the top environmental engineering design firms, Geosyntec is internationally known for its technical leadership, broad experience, and exceptional client service.
We invest in our people. Each employee is unique, and your career at Geosyntec will be too. We offer competitive pay and benefits, and well-being programs to support you and your family.
